    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40451" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-πάσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί-ττω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		inf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					4.951.119
				</span></i>
			 (Epid.), cf.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῆν</span>:—<i>sprinkle upon</i> or
			<i>over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἄρ᾽ ἤπια φάρμακα πάσσε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.218
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.401
			</span></i>, <u>IG</u>l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Euphro
				11.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ἐπί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.172
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>L.</u>
					455
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMar.</u>
				15.3
			</span></i>: c. partit. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς εἰρωνείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pisc.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				2.18
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ οἶνον</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλφιτα ἐπιπασθέντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					405e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				1.19
			</span></i>.</div>
